WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
I'll see you next time.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.600
Don't lose your grip on the dreams of the past

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.580
You must fight just to keep them alive

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.320
It's deep, I am the tiger

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:43.120
It's the thrill of the fight

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:47.080
Right in the middle to the heaven of our rival

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.120
And the last known survivor

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.960
Stumps his prey in the night

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.560
And he's watching us all

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:58.080
It's the eye of the tiger

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.080
You
